blessing.riftflux.desc.vampire=Heal 7% of damage dealt to enemies and, in direct sunlight, you take 20% more damage and deal 20% less damage
blessing.riftflux.desc.inferno=You don't take fire damage, and do +35% damage while on fire
blessing.riftflux.desc.diver=You can breathe underwater
blessing.riftflux.desc.berserker=Kills are counted until 10 - Key to toggle berserk mode. While active you deal 33% more damage, move 33% faster, take 33% less damage, and gain extra health - You lose 1 kill every 2 seconds, regain by bloodshed
